WEBVTT

00:00:03.461 --> 00:00:05.171
Otonokizaka High
Acceptance Announcements

00:00:08.592 --> 00:00:11.970
112, 113...

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:15.849
118!

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:16.975
I found it!

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:18.768
I found mine, too!

00:00:18.768 --> 00:00:19.936
Yukiho!

00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:21.187
Alisa!

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:23.023
We did it!

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:25.692
We did it! We both made it into Otonokizaka!

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.445
We're students of Otonokizaka High!

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:29.112
Yeah!

00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:32.699
And p's! I'm in J's!

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:37.287
Sis! I'm in g's! I going to join J's!

00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:40.165
You passed.

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:40.999
Yeah!

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:43.793
M's, huh?

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:46.880
I'm home...

00:00:47.631 --> 00:00:48.798
How'd it go!?

00:00:48.798 --> 00:00:52.052
You should've texted me!
I told you I'd go with you!

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:54.179
Huh? Oh, yeah...

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:55.555
I was accepted.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:56.431
Congratulations!

00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:58.683
Why are you so calm?

00:00:58.683 --> 00:01:02.187
You passed. We should be
celebrating. Celebrating!

00:01:02.187 --> 00:01:03.688
Hey, sis...

00:01:04.272 --> 00:01:09.903
What's u's going to do when
the third years graduate?

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:19.287
Saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:01:19.287 --> 00:01:26.878
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:39.307
Tsuyoi tsuyoi negaigoto ga
A strong, strong wish

00:01:39.307 --> 00:01:44.813
bokutachi wo michibiite kureta
Led us along

00:01:44.813 --> 00:01:49.901
tsugi wa zettai yuzurenaiyo
We can't give up the next one

00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:55.031
nokosareta jikan wo nigirishimete We'll hold
on tightly to the time we have remaining

00:01:55.031 --> 00:02:00.537
tada no omoide sore dake ja iyadayo
We don't want only a memory

00:02:00.537 --> 00:02:06.418
<i>seiippai chikara no kagiri hashirunda
We'll run as hard as we can</i>

00:02:06.418 --> 00:02:09.212
(CHANCE FOR ME CHANCE FOR YOU)
(Chance for me! Chance for you!)

00:02:09.212 --> 00:02:14.843
Saa yume wo dakishimetara ue wo muite
Come on... Embrace your dreams and look up

00:02:14.843 --> 00:02:19.639
kimi no sekai ga ohkiku kawaruyo
Your world will change dramatically

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:25.812
saa yume wo kanaeru no wa minna no yuuki Come
on... Our courage makes our dreams come true

00:02:25.812 --> 00:02:30.859
makenai (kokoro de) ashita e kaketeyukou Let's
run toward tomorrow with unbeaten (hearts)

00:02:30.859 --> 00:02:36.156
Ima koko de deaeta kiseki
The miracle that we met here and now

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:42.871
wasurenaide bokutachi no kisetsu
Don't forget our season

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:48.376
Love Live is only one more month away.

00:02:48.376 --> 00:02:53.548
We'll avoid straining ourselves in practice by
simply maintaining our physical conditioning.

00:02:53.548 --> 00:02:56.134
We're not practicing much, huh?

00:02:56.134 --> 00:02:58.595
#11 - Our Decision Yeah. There are even
days when we won't have practice at all.

00:02:58.803 --> 00:03:04.058
Yes. A-RISE advised us to include days off.

00:03:06.019 --> 00:03:06.895
Honoka?

00:03:06.895 --> 00:03:07.687
Huh?

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:09.189
Were you listening?

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:11.566
Y-Yeah. Sorry...

00:03:11.941 --> 00:03:15.987
By the way, weren't Alisa-chan
and Yukiho-chan accepted?

00:03:15.987 --> 00:03:20.325
Yeah. They'll both be new students
at Otonokizaka High this spring.

00:03:20.325 --> 00:03:24.496
Alisa-chan has been wanting
to join p's for a while now.

00:03:24.913 --> 00:03:27.123
Will she become a new member?

00:03:27.123 --> 00:03:29.209
We'll finally have a tenth member?

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:31.461
Hey! Don't talk about that.

00:03:33.922 --> 00:03:37.008
You'll be graduating, huh...

00:03:40.678 --> 00:03:41.554
I don't know...

00:03:42.347 --> 00:03:45.391
...if Nico-cchi will be able to graduate.

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:46.226
I will!

00:03:53.983 --> 00:03:57.779
Until Love Live is over, we won't discuss what
happens afterward. That was our promise.

00:03:58.238 --> 00:04:00.156
Come on. Let's practice.

00:04:00.156 --> 00:04:01.115
Okay!

00:04:08.998 --> 00:04:10.792
Did something happen?

00:04:10.792 --> 00:04:11.459
Huh?

00:04:11.459 --> 00:04:14.045
It's written all over your face.

00:04:14.045 --> 00:04:20.468
Yeah. Yukiho asked me what we're going
to do when the third years graduate.

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:22.178
I see.

00:04:22.178 --> 00:04:24.389
What do you think, Honoka?

00:04:24.389 --> 00:04:26.683
I'll keep being a school idol.

00:04:26.683 --> 00:04:29.811
I love to sing, and I want to
keep putting on concerts.

00:04:29.811 --> 00:04:30.979
But...

00:04:30.979 --> 00:04:33.690
You're not sure if we should keep being J's.

00:04:35.441 --> 00:04:37.110
Here we go!

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:37.777
Okay!

00:04:40.071 --> 00:04:41.406
I agree.

00:04:41.865 --> 00:04:45.243
I'm not sure we can call it y's
once the three of them are gone.

00:04:45.743 --> 00:04:47.161
You're right.

00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:50.415
Why do they have to graduate?

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:52.917
- You should keep it going.
- What?

00:04:52.917 --> 00:04:57.797
Even if your members graduate or
drop out, don't change the name.

00:04:57.797 --> 00:04:59.173
That's part of being an idol.

00:04:59.674 --> 00:05:01.050
An idol?

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:01.509
That's right.

00:05:01.509 --> 00:05:08.224
The three of us who are graduating
would prefer if you kept the name, so...

00:05:09.559 --> 00:05:10.727
Ouch!

00:05:10.727 --> 00:05:14.564
Didn't we promise not to talk about
that until after Love Live was over?

00:05:14.564 --> 00:05:16.190
I Know.

00:05:17.025 --> 00:05:20.194
Is that really the right thing to do?

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:21.404
Hanayo.

00:05:21.404 --> 00:05:26.451
I mean... Alisa-chan and
Yukiho-chan want to join J's, right?

00:05:26.451 --> 00:05:29.662
Shouldn't we give them a straight answer?

00:05:30.288 --> 00:05:33.541
If I were in their position,
I think it would be difficult.

00:05:33.541 --> 00:05:35.543
What do you think, Kayo-chin?

00:05:35.543 --> 00:05:36.127
Huh?

00:05:36.628 --> 00:05:39.088
Do you want to continue being p's?

00:05:39.088 --> 00:05:39.964
Well...

00:05:39.964 --> 00:05:43.259
Why are you holding back?
You should keep going.

00:05:43.259 --> 00:05:48.181
It'd be different if the entire roster were
changing, but the six of you will still be here.

00:05:48.181 --> 00:05:50.433
We're not holding back.

00:05:50.433 --> 00:05:54.479
It's just that to me, p's is these nine members.

00:05:54.479 --> 00:05:57.065
I think there will be a difference
if one member is gone.

00:05:57.899 --> 00:06:03.321
I agree with Hanayo, but I understand
what Nico-chan is saying, too.

00:06:03.321 --> 00:06:06.032
Erasing the name p's would be hard.

00:06:06.032 --> 00:06:09.535
Maybe it would be better to keep being y's...

00:06:09.535 --> 00:06:11.496
Right? That's how it should be.

00:06:11.496 --> 00:06:12.372
What about you, Eli-chi?

00:06:16.084 --> 00:06:18.086
I can't decide.

00:06:18.086 --> 00:06:21.339
Shouldn't it be up to Honoka and the others?

00:06:21.339 --> 00:06:22.173
Huh?

00:06:22.173 --> 00:06:25.093
Our graduation is inevitable.

00:06:25.093 --> 00:06:27.387
We can't continue being school idols.

00:06:27.887 --> 00:06:31.015
So, we should have no say
in what happens after that.

00:06:31.015 --> 00:06:32.809
That's what I believe.

00:06:32.809 --> 00:06:36.312
Honoka and the others have
to decide. That's what I think.

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:38.022
Eli...

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:40.233
You're right.

00:06:44.988 --> 00:06:48.282
We ended up talking about it, after all.

00:06:48.282 --> 00:06:50.743
But I don't think we had a choice.

00:06:51.327 --> 00:06:55.415
We shouldn't go to the Love Live
competition with any uncertainty.

00:06:55.832 --> 00:06:57.333
But what are we going to do?

00:06:57.333 --> 00:07:00.128
We have to decide, right?

00:07:00.128 --> 00:07:01.546
It's so hard.

00:07:01.546 --> 00:07:05.508
Yeah, but I think Eli-chan's right.

00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:08.761
We'll be the ones at school next year.

00:07:09.387 --> 00:07:11.139
We have to decide.

00:07:12.682 --> 00:07:13.641
You're right.

00:07:15.977 --> 00:07:16.769
Bye.

00:07:17.186 --> 00:07:18.312
Honoka.

00:07:19.022 --> 00:07:19.772
Huh?

00:07:20.148 --> 00:07:25.028
Let's be honest with ourselves when we think
about and discuss what we really want to do.

00:07:25.486 --> 00:07:26.195
Yeah.

00:07:27.196 --> 00:07:28.740
I'm home.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:31.659
Welcome home.

00:07:33.119 --> 00:07:34.287
Honoka-san!

00:07:34.287 --> 00:07:35.371
Welcome.

00:07:37.123 --> 00:07:37.915
Excuse me.

00:07:38.833 --> 00:07:41.169
Honoka-san, do you have a minute?

00:07:41.544 --> 00:07:42.795
What is it?

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:44.380
Um...

00:07:46.174 --> 00:07:50.178
M's...music...start!

00:07:51.971 --> 00:07:54.307
How was that? I practiced!

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:57.477
Yeah, it was perfect.

00:07:57.477 --> 00:08:00.104
Really? I'm so glad to hear that.

00:08:01.606 --> 00:08:03.066
I...

00:08:05.151 --> 00:08:08.279
Do you think I have what it takes to join J's?

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:16.496
Alisa, my sister has a concert coming up.
Don't bother her too much.

00:08:17.663 --> 00:08:20.374
Sorry. Make yourself at home.

00:08:28.049 --> 00:08:29.133
Khorosho!

00:08:29.133 --> 00:08:32.011
Yukiho, let's practice this part tomorrow.

00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:32.762
Okay.

00:08:36.891 --> 00:08:38.309
Listen, Alisa.

00:08:39.644 --> 00:08:42.271
What do you like about p's?

00:08:42.271 --> 00:08:42.814
Huh?

00:08:43.356 --> 00:08:45.191
What do you like most?

00:08:47.985 --> 00:08:49.320
Yukiho?

00:08:56.202 --> 00:08:57.620
You should keep it going.

00:09:01.624 --> 00:09:05.128
I'm not sure we can call it u's
once the three of them are gone.

00:09:08.422 --> 00:09:11.634
Honoka and the others have
to decide. That's what I think.

00:09:14.637 --> 00:09:16.139
You're right.

00:09:23.729 --> 00:09:26.691
Do you think I have what it takes to join u's?

00:09:30.027 --> 00:09:31.404
I don't know.

00:09:37.243 --> 00:09:40.705
I think that would be best.

00:09:41.497 --> 00:09:42.123
What do you think?

00:09:46.669 --> 00:09:47.628
Yeah.

00:09:54.552 --> 00:09:55.928
See you later.

00:09:56.554 --> 00:09:59.473
I couldn't make up my mind.

00:09:59.974 --> 00:10:01.601
Sis.

00:10:02.602 --> 00:10:03.644
Yukiho.

00:10:03.644 --> 00:10:05.897
We need to talk to you.

00:10:06.397 --> 00:10:07.315
Do you have a minute?

00:10:07.315 --> 00:10:08.024
Huh?

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:12.403
Um, [___

00:10:14.989 --> 00:10:19.327
I'm not going to be joining J's.

00:10:19.327 --> 00:10:20.203
What?

00:10:23.956 --> 00:10:27.210
Yesterday, I understood after Yukiho told me.

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:31.255
I love p's. I love the nine of you.

00:10:31.255 --> 00:10:36.010
I love the way you make progress,
step by step, together.

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:38.679
Alisa-chan.

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:44.977
I don't see myself in J's, the
school idol group that I love.

00:10:46.229 --> 00:10:51.776
That's why I'll aim to become
my own khorosho school idol.

00:10:52.693 --> 00:10:54.111
With Yukiho.

00:10:55.947 --> 00:10:59.033
I hope you'll show us the ropes, senpai.

00:11:00.284 --> 00:11:01.160
Just kidding.

00:11:05.122 --> 00:11:06.707
Is that...okay?

00:11:08.751 --> 00:11:09.669
No.

00:11:15.091 --> 00:11:16.175
Sis!?

00:11:16.175 --> 00:11:21.180
You're right. It's so obvious,
I should've known.

00:11:24.684 --> 00:11:25.726
Do your best!

00:11:26.227 --> 00:11:27.270
Okay!

00:11:43.286 --> 00:11:44.662
Love Live!

00:11:46.914 --> 00:11:49.625
All right! Let's have fun!

00:11:49.625 --> 00:11:50.584
Fun?

00:11:51.085 --> 00:11:54.880
I was wondering why you
invited us out on a Sunday...

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:56.841
Weren't we supposed to rest?

00:11:56.841 --> 00:12:00.011
Yeah, but we need a change of pace.

00:12:00.011 --> 00:12:03.806
Besides, it'll be better to be full
of joy when we stand onstage.

00:12:03.806 --> 00:12:05.516
Th-That's right.

00:12:05.516 --> 00:12:07.226
It's warm out today.

00:12:07.226 --> 00:12:10.604
I read in a book once that having
fun helps one recover mentally.

00:12:10.604 --> 00:12:13.232
That's right. Staying cooped
up inside won't do any good.

00:12:13.232 --> 00:12:14.025
Yeah!

00:12:14.025 --> 00:12:17.028
What? You're awfully pushy today.

00:12:17.028 --> 00:12:21.782
Besides, we've never really hung
out together since we formed 's.

00:12:21.782 --> 00:12:24.035
I thought it'd be nice to do it just once.

00:12:24.035 --> 00:12:26.537
But what are we going to do?

00:12:26.537 --> 00:12:27.997
I wanna go to an amusement park!

00:12:27.997 --> 00:12:30.166
What a child... I choose the art museum.

00:12:30.166 --> 00:12:32.668
I'd like to start with going to an idol shop!

00:12:32.668 --> 00:12:34.462
We're all over the place!

00:12:34.462 --> 00:12:35.796
What are we going to do?

00:12:37.798 --> 00:12:39.342
All of them!

00:12:39.342 --> 00:12:40.468
What!?

00:12:40.468 --> 00:12:42.803
Let's go everywhere we wanna go!

00:12:42.803 --> 00:12:43.637
Seriously?

00:12:43.971 --> 00:12:47.350
Yeah. Everyone, choose one
place you want to go.

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:49.643
We'll visit all of them! How's that sound?

00:12:49.643 --> 00:12:50.770
Are you serious?

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:52.938
But it does sound kind of fun.

00:12:52.938 --> 00:12:54.607
All right, that's fine.

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:00.613
Let's go!

00:13:01.697 --> 00:13:02.448
Amazing!

00:13:02.448 --> 00:13:05.534
This is all y's stuff! p's!

00:13:05.534 --> 00:13:06.786
It's too embarrassing.

00:13:06.786 --> 00:13:10.373
Where is the pre-order bonus for
The Legendary Idol Legend blu-ray?

00:13:12.583 --> 00:13:14.126
I lost!

00:13:14.668 --> 00:13:17.380
Now I'm the best dancer in the universe!

00:13:17.797 --> 00:13:20.466
She must've regretted losing before...

00:13:20.466 --> 00:13:22.009
More importantly...

00:13:26.722 --> 00:13:28.599
Something crazy's going on!

00:13:29.683 --> 00:13:30.393
Hooray!

00:13:34.522 --> 00:13:36.899
They're professionals at standing on one foot.

00:13:42.446 --> 00:13:44.156
Bowling's so fun!

00:13:44.156 --> 00:13:46.325
Khorosho.

00:13:48.786 --> 00:13:49.829
Quiet.

00:13:49.829 --> 00:13:50.830
Shh!

00:13:51.789 --> 00:13:53.582
Yeah!

00:13:53.582 --> 00:13:55.793
We lost because you said we should go right!

00:13:55.793 --> 00:13:57.920
It's because you went left!

00:14:00.464 --> 00:14:02.550
How spiritual...

00:14:12.893 --> 00:14:16.355
All that's left is where you
want to go, Honoka.

00:14:17.273 --> 00:14:20.568
I actually...want to go to the beach.

00:14:20.568 --> 00:14:21.444
The beach?

00:14:21.444 --> 00:14:28.659
Yeah. I wanna go to a deserted beach, where
just the nine of us can see something special.

00:14:28.659 --> 00:14:29.743
Is that okay?

00:14:30.703 --> 00:14:31.745
Honoka...

00:14:31.745 --> 00:14:33.164
I'm
in!

00:14:33.164 --> 00:14:36.250
It's like an exciting adventure!

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:37.501
We're going now?

00:14:37.501 --> 00:14:39.545
Let's at least go!

00:14:46.385 --> 00:14:47.261
This is it!

00:14:47.261 --> 00:14:48.721
Get on, girls!

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:56.687
We made it...

00:14:58.564 --> 00:14:59.523
Honoka.

00:15:00.691 --> 00:15:02.860
Are you mentally prepared?

00:15:03.944 --> 00:15:05.112
Yeah.

00:15:19.335 --> 00:15:21.629
It's just starting to set!

00:15:21.629 --> 00:15:24.256
It must be because of the spiritual power.

00:15:24.256 --> 00:15:27.760
Our good karma is paying off.

00:16:02.836 --> 00:16:06.131
We watched the sunrise
like this on our club trip.

00:16:06.131 --> 00:16:07.383
Yeah.

00:16:08.842 --> 00:16:10.219
Listen...

00:16:15.641 --> 00:16:20.688
Listen... The six of us got together
afterward and talked about our future.

00:16:20.688 --> 00:16:27.861
About what p's would do after Nozomi-chan,
Nico-chan, and Eli-chan graduate.

00:16:27.861 --> 00:16:28.529
Honoka.

00:16:28.988 --> 00:16:30.948
We each gave our own answer.

00:16:31.574 --> 00:16:34.535
And we all agreed.

00:16:35.119 --> 00:16:36.954
Everyone's answer was the same.

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:41.792
We decided that was what we'll do...

00:16:43.919 --> 00:16:45.462
Let's tell them. Ready...

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:48.716
Sorry. Let's tell them.

00:16:49.216 --> 00:16:51.093
Ready, and...

00:16:51.093 --> 00:16:56.932
Once the competition is over, we will end u's!

00:17:06.483 --> 00:17:08.986
It has to be the nine of us.

00:17:09.486 --> 00:17:11.655
The nine of us are J's.

00:17:12.489 --> 00:17:17.745
We know it's normal for
members to leave and join.

00:17:17.745 --> 00:17:20.456
But that's not us.

00:17:20.456 --> 00:17:22.541
The nine of us are J's.

00:17:22.541 --> 00:17:25.252
I can't imagine p's without all of us.

00:17:25.961 --> 00:17:29.048
If even one person's missing, it won't be J's.

00:17:30.424 --> 00:17:31.133
I see.

00:17:31.133 --> 00:17:32.134
Eli!

00:17:32.134 --> 00:17:34.136
I agree.

00:17:34.136 --> 00:17:35.554
Nozomi.

00:17:35.554 --> 00:17:37.931
It's obvious.

00:17:37.931 --> 00:17:41.769
The way I felt watching us,
and naming this group...

00:17:42.478 --> 00:17:45.731
There's only the nine of us.

00:17:45.731 --> 00:17:47.775
M's is only the nine of us.

00:17:49.109 --> 00:17:52.655
L... I know that!

00:17:52.655 --> 00:17:55.199
And I agree...

00:17:55.199 --> 00:17:57.576
But... But...even then...

00:17:57.576 --> 00:17:59.036
Nico-chan.

00:17:59.536 --> 00:18:04.249
You know how I felt about being a school idol.

00:18:05.584 --> 00:18:11.048
Just when I started giving up in my
third year, I found this miracle!

00:18:11.048 --> 00:18:12.549
These wonderful idols!

00:18:13.133 --> 00:18:15.552
I found friends!

00:18:15.552 --> 00:18:19.181
- Once it's over, it will never—
- We'll keep being idols!

00:18:19.556 --> 00:18:23.102
I promise! No matter what
happens, we'll keep being idols!

00:18:23.102 --> 00:18:24.186
Maki...

00:18:24.186 --> 00:18:27.356
But I want p's to be only ours!

00:18:27.356 --> 00:18:30.109
I don't want a J's without you!

00:18:30.109 --> 00:18:31.902
I don't want it!

00:18:33.237 --> 00:18:36.240
Kayo-chin, we promised not to cry.

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:39.827
I'm doing my best, but...I...

00:18:42.496 --> 00:18:43.205
Huh?

00:18:43.789 --> 00:18:47.668
The time! If we don't hurry up,
we'll miss our train home!

00:18:47.668 --> 00:18:48.502
Huh?

00:18:48.502 --> 00:18:49.211
Honoka-chan?

00:18:55.509 --> 00:18:56.719
When's the next train?

00:18:57.344 --> 00:18:59.012
There are plenty of trains left.

00:18:59.012 --> 00:18:59.930
What?

00:19:00.681 --> 00:19:01.724
Sorry.

00:19:02.182 --> 00:19:03.475
Honoka-chan...

00:19:04.143 --> 00:19:07.146
You all looked like you were going to cry...

00:19:08.147 --> 00:19:12.568
If we stayed there, you wouldn't
have been able to stop yourselves.

00:19:14.486 --> 00:19:16.864
You got us this time.

00:19:16.864 --> 00:19:19.408
We ran as fast as we could.

00:19:19.408 --> 00:19:23.829
Yeah. We were supposed to be saving
our energy, but we used it all up.

00:19:23.829 --> 00:19:26.498
I wanted to see the ocean a little longer...

00:19:26.498 --> 00:19:30.961
But I'm glad. We came to a
place where it was only us.

00:19:30.961 --> 00:19:31.837
You're right.

00:19:32.629 --> 00:19:36.550
Only the nine of us saw the
ocean from there today.

00:19:37.259 --> 00:19:41.305
Only the nine of us are
here in this station now.

00:19:41.305 --> 00:19:43.807
It was wonderful.

00:19:43.807 --> 00:19:45.601
Why don't we take a picture?

00:19:46.518 --> 00:19:48.479
I've got my phone.

00:19:48.479 --> 00:19:49.938
Not like that.

00:19:49.938 --> 00:19:52.065
Let's take one here together...

00:19:52.483 --> 00:19:53.484
...as a memento.

00:19:57.362 --> 00:19:59.156
Hey, don't push me!

00:19:59.156 --> 00:20:01.325
Ow, ow, ow, that hurts!

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:04.953
It's starting.

00:20:08.457 --> 00:20:10.918
Nico-chan, your head's cut off.

00:20:11.585 --> 00:20:13.796
Maki-chan, you're making a weird face.

00:20:13.796 --> 00:20:16.632
Well, only your hand is in the shot, Rin.

00:20:17.216 --> 00:20:19.176
Nico-cchi, this is awful.

00:20:19.176 --> 00:20:20.761
I was feeling adventurous.

00:20:20.761 --> 00:20:22.971
Is this my hair?

00:20:22.971 --> 00:20:24.932
What is this?

00:20:24.932 --> 00:20:29.144
Look at Nozomi! Nico's hair makes
it look like she has a mustache!

00:20:38.278 --> 00:20:40.447
Kayo-chin, you're crying.

00:20:40.447 --> 00:20:43.283
It's just...so funny that my tears are...

00:20:45.035 --> 00:20:50.165
Don't cry. You can't cry!
You were just laughing.

00:20:52.042 --> 00:20:54.461
Jeez... Stop that!

00:20:54.461 --> 00:20:56.630
I told you to stop...

00:20:59.633 --> 00:21:01.677
Why are we crying?

00:21:03.971 --> 00:21:06.265
It's weird.

00:21:06.265 --> 00:21:07.975
Honoka-chan!

00:21:14.857 --> 00:21:18.610
Quit crying! Why are you all crying?

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:20.070
Nico-cchi...

00:21:21.154 --> 00:21:24.074
I won't cry! I won't cry!

00:21:24.616 --> 00:21:26.368
I said I wouldn't cry.

00:21:27.870 --> 00:21:31.415
Stop. Don't do that.

00:21:56.398 --> 00:21:58.400
That should do it.

00:21:58.400 --> 00:21:59.693
Let's go practice!

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:00.694
Okay!

00:22:01.361 --> 00:22:07.200
Fight! One more week
till our last concert!

00:22:15.083 --> 00:22:20.881
Ureshiikara kimi ni ai ni ikou
Because I'm happy, I'll go see you

00:22:20.881 --> 00:22:26.637
samishiikara kimi ni ai ni ikou (ai ni ikuyo)
Because I'm lonely, I'll go see you (I'll go see you)

00:22:27.054 --> 00:22:29.932
Sonna kimochi ni narunda
That's how I feel

00:22:29.932 --> 00:22:32.893
susumu toki nayamu toki Whether I'm
making progress or hung up on something,

00:22:32.893 --> 00:22:36.897
tsunagatteirundane zutto
We're always connected

00:22:38.398 --> 00:22:44.029
<i>honki no yume de (HI LETS GO) asu wo tsukamu (HI GO GO) With
a true dream, (Hi! Let's go') seize tomorrow (Hi! Go, go')</i>

00:22:44.029 --> 00:22:51.495
Kitto dekiruyo kimi nara
I'm sure you can do it

00:22:53.914 --> 00:22:59.753
tama ni wa yukkuri kimi no pehsu de
Sometimes, take your time at your own pace

00:22:59.753 --> 00:23:05.592
yaritai kototachi mitsumetegoran
To look at all the things you want to do

00:23:05.592 --> 00:23:12.641
sono ato ganbare zenryokudene (ganbarouyo) Then do
your best! With all your strength (Let's do our best)

00:23:12.641 --> 00:23:21.692
Kibun ga harete ohzora e maiagaruyo Once you've
cleared your head, you'll fly up into the sky

00:23:22.234 --> 00:23:32.619
donna toki datte kimi wo mitsumeteru
I'm always looking at you

00:23:35.455 --> 00:23:39.334
Next time on Love Live!
"Last Concert"
